      "in Bacigalupi's world, technological dominion had shifted eastward. Chinese systems were both supplier and sovereign, building the infrastructure of power for a venal West. today that prophecy has largely come true. supply chains, chip fabrication, and data centre construction all depend heavily on Chinese industry. the balance of technical mastery has been recast, not by ideology but by necessity.",
