      "the standard definition of soup is a liquid food made of various ingredients, usually cooked together and served warm. at first glance the ocean looks nothing like that: it is not made for eating, not served in bowls, and certainly not the product of a chef's intention. but press on these distinctions and some surprising parallels appear.",
